{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53173","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 林晕","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求获真乘妙，言归倍有情。\n玄关心地得，乡思日边生。\n作梵慈云布，浮杯涨海清。\n看看达彼岸，长老散华迎。\n（同前）（按：自吴顗以下九人诗，均转引自张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林晕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}